### GET request to example server
GET http://localhost:8080

### Find all
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineers

### Find by Id
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineers/1


### POST add data to database
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kevin",
  "techStack": "laravel, nuxt, vue"
}

### DELETE request by Id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineers/1

### UPDATE data in the database
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "techStack": "Java, Spring Boot, PostgreSQL"
}